{"parentUuid":"0b9e8893-7652-48c6-8c57-9c01a8eb7893","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a08387fbca2c9ad18","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_016iWesj76jbV5tJkHxWjvwb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K1bgeUAS2DJN2mwxdDWeA8","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\runtime\\process_tree_telemetry.py","limit":80},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2739,"cache_read_input_tokens":47533,"output_tokens":279,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2739},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":279,"cache_read_input_tokens":47533,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2739,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2739,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaosWhkmibYhXXaN8Mh69","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a36806d3-c52a-44cc-9f33-ac01909cccf4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:51.309Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a36806d3-c52a-44cc-9f33-ac01909cccf4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d2d8c1c5-cf59-474f-8fab-14abba897913","agentId":"a08387fbca2c9ad18","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K1bgeUAS2DJN2mwxdDWeA8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n2\t\n3\timport json\n4\timport os\n5\timport time\n6\tfrom pathlib import Path\n7\tfrom typing import Any, Iterable\n8\t\n9\timport psutil\n10\t\n11\t\n12\tclass ProcessTreeSampler:\n13\t    def __init__(self, root_pid: int | None = None) -> None:\n14\t        self.root_pid = int(os.getpid() if root_pid is None else root_pid)\n15\t        self._process_cache: dict[int, psutil.Process] = {}\n16\t\n17\t    def sample(self) -> dict[str, Any]:\n18\t        processes = [_process_snapshot(process) for process in self._iter_processes()]\n19\t        return {\n20\t            \"schema\": \"phase3b-process-tree-telemetry-sample/v0\",\n21\t            \"sample_time_unix\": time.time(),\n22\t            \"root_pid\": self.root_pid,\n23\t            \"processes\": processes,\n24\t            \"aggregate\": _aggregate(processes),\n25\t        }\n26\t\n27\t    def _iter_processes(self) -> list[psutil.Process]:\n28\t        try:\n29\t            root = self._cached_process(self.root_pid)\n30\t            processes = [root]\n31\t            processes.extend(root.children(recursive=True))\n32\t        except (psutil.NoSuchProcess, psutil.AccessDenied, psutil.ZombieProcess, OSError):\n33\t            return []\n34\t        cached: list[psutil.Process] = []\n35\t        seen: set[int] = set()\n36\t        for process in processes:\n37\t            if int(process.pid) in seen:\n38\t                continue\n39\t            seen.add(int(process.pid))\n40\t            cached.append(self._cached_process(int(process.pid)))\n41\t        return cached\n42\t\n43\t    def _cached_process(self, pid: int) -> psutil.Process:\n44\t        if pid not in self._process_cache:\n45\t            self._process_cache[pid] = psutil.Process(pid)\n46\t        return self._process_cache[pid]\n47\t\n48\t\n49\tdef sample_process_tree(root_pid: int | None = None) -> dict[str, Any]:\n50\t    return ProcessTreeSampler(root_pid).sample()\n51\t\n52\t\n53\tdef append_jsonl(path: Path, payload: dict[str, Any]) -> None:\n54\t    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n55\t    with Path(path).open(\"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as handle:\n56\t        json.dump(payload, handle, ensure_ascii=False, sort_keys=True)\n57\t        handle.write(\"\\n\")\n58\t\n59\t\n60\tdef summarize_telemetry_samples(samples: Iterable[dict[str, Any]]) -> dict[str, Any]:\n61\t    sample_list = [sample for sample in samples if isinstance(sample, dict)]\n62\t    if not sample_list:\n63\t        return {\n64\t            \"sample_count\": 0,\n65\t            \"peak_process_count\": 0,\n66\t            \"peak_thread_count\": 0,\n67\t            \"peak_total_rss_bytes\": 0,\n68\t            \"peak_total_private_bytes\": 0,\n69\t            \"peak_total_cpu_percent\": 0.0,\n70\t        }\n71\t    aggregates = [\n72\t        sample.get(\"aggregate\", {}) for sample in sample_list if isinstance(sample.get(\"aggregate\"), dict)\n73\t    ]\n74\t    return {\n75\t        \"sample_count\": len(sample_list),\n76\t        \"peak_process_count\": max((int(agg.get(\"process_count\", 0)) for agg in aggregates), default=0),\n77\t        \"peak_thread_count\": max((int(agg.get(\"thread_count\", 0)) for agg in aggregates), default=0),\n78\t        \"peak_total_rss_bytes\": max((int(agg.get(\"total_rss_bytes\", 0)) for agg in aggregates), default=0),\n79\t        \"peak_total_private_bytes\": max(\n80\t            (int(agg.get(\"total_private_bytes\", 0)) for agg in aggregates),"}]},"uuid":"eac12cfa-a97e-4416-bfad-36d4ea23fb8a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:52:51.319Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a36806d3-c52a-44cc-9f33-ac01909cccf4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"eac12cfa-a97e-4416-bfad-36d4ea23fb8a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a08387fbca2c9ad18","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01SWF6sTEkBaxSyFbmpcHkbJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough. Here's the consolidated brief.\n\n---\n\n# CP-SAT 内存深度调研：70x70 + 266 设施 31 GiB 拆分\n\n## 1. CP-SAT 内部数据结构\n\nCP-SAT 是 LCG 架构（lazy clause generation = CP propagator + SAT 引擎），主要内存吃在五块：\n\n- **CpModelProto + presolve 后的中间表示**：变量、约束、affine 关系、域映射\n- **Boolean 编码层**：每个 integer 变量被 lazy 展开成多个 Bool（域内每个值/界一个 literal）\n- **Watched literals**：每变量 2 个数组指针 + 大小，按 [msoos blog](https://www.msoos.org/tag/memory-layout/) 是 **32 字节/变量**（64 位指针 + 32 位 size）\n- **Learned clause 数据库**：clause 数组本身 + activity score + LBD\n- **Linear relaxation（LP）矩阵**：默认 `linearization_level=1`，2 翻倍\n- **Implication graph + propagator state**：每个 propagator 各自维护 trail/reason\n\n## 2. 典型分布数据（CDCL 经验值）\n\n研究文献没有给出干净的\"50/30/20\"分布，但能锚定几个数：\n\n- watched literals：**32 B/变量**，1M 变量 = 32 MiB（[msoos](https://www.msoos.org/tag/memory-layout/)）\n- 平均 learned clause 长度 8–15 literals，每 literal 4–8 字节 + clause header（activity, LBD, length）≈ **~80–150 B/clause**\n- num_conflicts 百万级 → clause DB 原始大小 100M-150M B = **0.1–0.15 GiB**（如果不 cleanup）\n- 真正吃内存大头是 **8 个 portfolio worker 的独立 state**\n\n## 3. 实测分布的工具\n\n- **Memray**（[bloomberg/memray](https://github.com/bloomberg/memray)）：能穿透 pybind11 看到 C++ 栈，但**只支持 Linux/macOS**，Windows 不能用\n- **VMMap**（[Sysinternals](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sysinternals/downloads/vmmap)）：Windows 上的最佳工具，按 Heap/Private/Mapped 分类。**这是你这台机器唯一靠谱的方案**\n- **py-spy --native** ([benfred/py-spy](https://github.com/benfred/py-spy))：只做 CPU 采样，不做内存\n- **tracemalloc**：只跟 Python 端，C++ 看不见\n\n## 4. CP-SAT 内存膨胀机制\n\n- **Presolve/inprocessing 阶段会临时翻倍**：probing + BVE（bounded variable elimination）会克隆中间结构。`presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit=30` ([proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto))\n- **每次 restart 触发 inprocessing**，重做 SAT presolve\n- **`AddAbsEquality` 案例**：[issue #2048](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/2048) 用户从 7 GiB 涨到 32 GiB（7 worker），无新解，根因没定论但形态像 clause DB 不收敛\n\n## 5. 可压缩部分\n\n- `clause_cleanup_period` 默认 **10000**，调到 5000 触发更频繁清理\n- `clause_cleanup_ratio` 默认 **0.5**，调到 0.7 删更狠\n- `clause_cleanup_lbd_bound` 默认 **5**，调到 3 只保留高质量 glue clause\n- `share_glue_clauses` / `share_binary_clauses` **关掉**节省 worker 间 clause 复制\n- `linearization_level` 从默认 1 降到 0 砍掉 LP 矩阵\n- **`num_search_workers` 从 8 降到 4**：每 worker 独立 state，**这是最有效的 50% 削减**\n- `max_memory_in_mb` 默认 **10000 MB**，可硬封顶但会强制中止\n\n## 6. 不可压缩部分（floor）\n\n- CpModelProto 本身：266 设施 × 候选位置数 × 模式数 → 决策变量基数\n- 70×70=4900 cell × 266 facility × ~5 mode ≈ 数百万 placement bool；按 32 B watched literal floor = **几百 MiB 是不可压的**\n- presolve 后 booleans 数（log 里的 `#bools`）× 32 B 是绝对下限\n\n## 7. 规模缩放\n\n- 50×50 + 100 设施：~2-4 GiB\n- 70×70 + 266 设施：**31 GiB（你测的）**\n- 80×80 + 500 设施：变量数 ~6.7×，但 worker state 是叠加，clause learning 超线性，估 **80–120 GiB**（不可行）\n\n经验关系大致是 **O(N × log N) 到 O(N^1.5)**，因为 watched literal 是 O(N)、clause DB 跟问题难度超线性。\n\n## 8. OR-Tools 历史内存优化\n\n- 9.0 → 9.2 出现回归（[issue #3212](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/3212)），之后专门做了 inprocessing 内存压缩\n- v9.4+ 修了 random pool 的 reachable bytes\n- [issue #2048](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/2048) 仍未根本解决，是 portfolio + restart inprocessing 的结构性放大\n\n## 9. 跟你 9 GiB 主进程 + 31 GiB 总 RSS 的估算分解\n\n假设 8 worker、log 显示 ~50 万 booleans、几百万 conflicts：\n\n| 块 | 估算 | 是否可压 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Python + numpy + 框架 | 0.5–1 GiB | 否 |\n| CpModelProto（presolve 前） | 1–2 GiB | 部分（精简 model） |\n| presolve 后 booleans 编码（核心 model） | 2–3 GiB × 1（共享） | 否（floor） |\n| 每 worker 私有 state（trail/reason/propagator） | ~1.5 GiB × 8 = **12 GiB** | **是（减 worker）** |\n| 每 worker learned clauses + activity | ~1 GiB × 8 = **8 GiB** | **是（cleanup 激进）** |\n| LP 矩阵（linearization_level=1） | ~0.5 GiB × 8 = 4 GiB | 是（关 LP） |\n| watched literals + impl graph | ~0.3 GiB × 8 = 2.5 GiB | 否 |\n\n**31 GiB 中约 50–60% 是 worker 私有 state（learned clauses + propagator trail）**，这部分压缩空间最大。\n\n## 10. Memory profiling 工程方案（落到你项目）\n\n`src/runtime/process_tree_telemetry.py:9-50` 已经有 psutil 取 RSS/private 的框架，加这些字段就能区分：\n\n1. **每 30 秒同步 dump CP-SAT log 的 `#bools/#conflicts/#clauses` 到 telemetry**：把 solver 进度跟 RSS 时序对齐\n2. **新增 `cp_sat_internal` 子字典**，从 `solver.ResponseStats()` 抽 num_booleans/num_conflicts/num_branches/num_restarts，跟 RSS 同 timestamp 落 jsonl\n3. **Windows 上加 VMMap CLI 钩子**：到达 RSS > 25 GiB 时一次性 `vmmap.exe -p <pid> -o vmmap.csv`，事后离线看是 Heap 还是 Private Data 还是 Mapped File\n4. **加内存桶分类**：\n   - `linear_floor` = `num_booleans × 32 + num_constraints × 64`（理论下限）\n   - `clauses_estimate` = `num_conflicts × 100 / num_workers`\n   - `worker_overhead` = `(rss - linear_floor - clauses_estimate) / num_workers`\n   后两者趋势能直接告诉你 cleanup 调激进的效果\n5. **A/B 跑 num_workers=4 vs 8，对照 RSS 曲线**：这是验证 worker overhead 假设最快的实验\n\n**优先级建议**：先做 (5) 那个 4 vs 8 worker A/B（一晚上能跑完，能直接砍 30-40% RSS 还不需要任何代码改动），再考虑 cleanup 参数 fine-tune。\n\n---\n\nSources:\n- [CP-SAT Primer - Under the Hood](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html)\n- [CP-SAT Primer - Understanding the Log](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/understanding_the_log.html)\n- [CP-SAT Primer - Parameters](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html)\n- [or-tools sat_parameters.proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [Issue #2048 - AddAbsEquality memory blowup 7→32GB](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/2048)\n- [Issue #3212 - CP-SAT memory leak v9.2](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/3212)\n- [msoos blog - SAT memory layout (32B/variable)](https://www.msoos.org/tag/memory-layout/)\n- [Lazy Clause Generation paper - Stuckey et al.](https://people.eng.unimelb.edu.au/pstuckey/papers/lazy.pdf)\n- [Memray - Python+native memory profiler (Linux/macOS only)](https://github.com/bloomberg/memray)\n- [Sysinternals VMMap - Windows process memory analyzer](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sysinternals/downloads/vmmap)\n- [py-spy - Python sampling profiler](https://github.com/benfred/py-spy)\n- [cpsat-logutils - log parsing](https://github.com/d-krupke/cpsat-logutils)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2148,"cache_read_input_tokens":50272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2148,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaosWyK9x4JaN4Ghdinvg","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"e8eafe50-b660-448b-93e1-25e25e98dcbe","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:53:53.140Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
